DESCRIPTION:Throughout the year\, LAB 5 The Mechanics of Truth has explore
 d the technological production of the real: how facts are assembled\, how 
 a belief is manufactured\, how perception is under constant pressure\, and
  how models and simulations can manipulate it or come to its rescue.OpenLA
 B brings this journey to a close.Over three days of talks and presentation
 s\, artists\, technologists\, designers\, thinkers\, and programme partici
 pants address these issues through artistic research practices\, grassroot
 s innovation\, and alternatives to the commercial mainstream. Among them a
 re the prototypes from the Collaborative Prototyping Laboratory\, develope
 d by 25 participants selected through an international ope\nCategory: Mult
 idisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedul
