DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTSTAMP:20261126T082645Z
UID:cd0604aa4c0fde919718b0c09018@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Un sistema de aprendizaje automático (machine learning) y una
  investigación forense tienen algo en común. Ambos trabajan con informac
 ión incompleta\, y cada uno tiene su manera de habitar esos vacíos. Pong
 amos por ejemplo un modelo de reconocimiento de imagen. Primero aprende de
  miles de imágenes en las que un humano ha anotado lo lo que hay que dest
 acar para luego enfrentarse a un mundo que no siempre se presta a ser reco
 nocido. Una investigación forense reconstruye un evento a partir de fragm
 entos que llegan de forma desigual\, cada uno incompleto a su manera\, y l
 os superpone para dar sentido a los huecos que dejan los otros. Esta charl
 a de Júlia Nueno sigue a uno de esos modelos\, desarrolla\nCategory: Mult
 idisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedul
 e/openlab-festival-mechanics-truth
LOCATION:Nave Una\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/openlab-festival-mechanics-
 truth
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OpenLAB 2026 | When the machine doubts - Talk by Júlia Nueno — 
 Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTSTAMP:20261126T082645Z
UID:f0ca45bec178516939d61c7cd35e@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:A targeting system and a forensic investigation both begin fro
 m incomplete information. Each one has its own way of inhabiting those gap
 s. Take\, for example\, an image recognition model. It first learns from t
 housands of images in which a human has annotated what should be picked ou
 t\, and then it confronts a world that does not always lend itself to bein
 g recognised. A forensic investigation reconstructs an event from fragment
 s that arrive unevenly\, each incomplete in its own way\, and layers them 
 so that each can make sense of the gaps the others leave. Júlia Nueno's t
 alk follows one of these models\, developed with Forensic Architecture\, t
 o map tents in satellite imagery and read the displace\nCategory: Multidis
 ciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/op
 enlab-2026-when-machine-doubts-talk-julia-nueno
LOCATION:Nave Una\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/openlab-2026-when-machine-d
 oubts-talk-julia-nueno
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
