 ourney with type 2 diabetes and his weight. Join the American Diabetes Ass
 ociation® (ADA) for a FREE exclusive film screening of ImPossible\, prese
 nted by Lewis Taylor Productions and directed by Seckeita Lewis. Inspired 
 by the real-life health journey of the co-writer and actor\, Brandon Lewis
 . ImPossible follows the character on his journey with type 2 diabetes and
  obesity\, as he forms an unlikely friendship that helps him to conquer hi
 s demons\, prove his worth and capture his dreams. Stars include Brandon\,
  JoMarie Payton (as seen on Family Matters)\, Gregg Daniel (as seen on Ins
 ecure) and Sherri Shepherd. Tickets are limited! Book your\nCategory: Film
